# One substance, two phases: filter only the solid
register lv2
add v1 water 12mol
add v1 SiO2 0.0004mol
add v1 NaCl 0.0008mol
new
filter v1 v2
inspect
# The aqueous equilibrium decides how much silica is dissolved. The filter
# then transfers the liquid phase and retains the solid phase; it does not
# decide by chemical identity.
